From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:23:13 +0000
Subject: fix(compose): propagate TextStyle.fontFamily to native text inputs

Compose TextField text styles dropped fontFamily. Map GenericFontFamily /
FontListFontFamily onto a new TextAreaAttr.fontFamily prop, and on iOS
apply it in KRTextFieldView/KRTextAreaView through a shared p_updateFont
that also passes the root view contextParam so dynamically loaded custom
fonts resolve (KRConvertUtil UIFont: fontFamily + contextParam).

Fork-Patch: input-font-family
Origin: 9110e97f, 539736ba
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

